WEBVTT

00:04:57.995 --> 00:05:03.224
ne nje spital ne Tahrir, dhe vendosa te marre nje jo

00:05:03.224 --> 00:05:05.538
nga Mauzoleum Mamluk ne Kairo.

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:07.323
Mesazhi thote,

00:05:07.323 --> 00:05:13.732
(arabisht)

00:05:13.732 --> 00:05:17.409
Mund te shtypesh lulet, por nuk mund te ndalosh pranveren"

00:05:17.409 --> 00:05:21.264
Falemnderit. (Duartrokitje)

00:05:21.264 --> 00:05:30.285
(duartrokitje)